# cargo-fuzz build + run artefacts (regenerated by `cargo +nightly fuzz run`):
#   target/    — the nightly/libFuzzer build output
#   corpus/    — coverage-guided inputs discovered at run time (per target)
#   artifacts/ — crash/timeout reproducers written on a failure
# None are product artefacts; the durable thing is the per-target *contract*,
# asserted by the targets here and (on the stable gate) by the proptest
# decode-fuzz tests in celnet-replog / celnet-journal.
/target
/corpus
/artifacts
# This standalone (non-workspace, never-published) crate's lockfile is not pinned
# in git; the nightly fuzz lane resolves it fresh.
Cargo.lock
